Interactive grid browser over the Cyberdeck sqlite substrate.
clutch sources live verbatim under db-vendor/clutch/ (with upstream
LICENSE; GPL-3.0 stays inside that directory). This unit only wires
load-path and exposes the browse command.

** Load path
Anchored on the vault root (compiled units load from the output
directory, so source-relative paths would misfire).
